{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1061688/block/singleImage/3256119/df/01M6FMV399S7PZB4XB5ZPD1574.jpg?updatedAt=1793674059\"/><figcaption>深水埗汝州街222號。（Google地圖截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>深水埗一間膠袋舖發生火警。 今日（3日）早上9時27分，深水埗汝州街222號地舖一間膠袋廠冒煙起火，驚動多名市民報警。警方和救援人員接報後趕至現場，消防出動一喉一煙帽隊灌救，約10分鐘將火救熄。火警中，有5人自行疏散，無人受傷。據知起火位置是舖頭後巷，消防正在調查火警原因。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T03:44:03.382189+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":161,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T02:47:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T12:58:53.934097+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T03:39:38.653646+00:00","content_hash":"c75fb17d470f5709118ce2f82d4c8ecb2935bcddd5386dca17588e4d19e2a185","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T03:44:03.382189+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}